  v(1fr)
  emph[“Sometimes a technology is so awe-inspiring that the imagination runs away with it -- often far, far away from reality. Robots are like that. A lot of big and ultimately unfulfilled promises were made in robotics early on, based on preliminary successes.”]
  align(right)[Daniel H. Wilson]
  v(6fr)
})
